Direction: Read the following pie chart carefully and answer the following questions. In this pie chart Men population of five villages is given.

Total number of men population in village is 4000.

The men population of Village P is 800. If the ratio of men to women in Village P is 4:5, calculate the total population of Village P. Additionally, what is the ratio of the total population of Village P to Village R, given Village R has 1,000 men and the ratio of men and women is same as village P?&nbsp;
